NOTE: Deleting WORK.THICK (memtype=DATA).
9904     !                                         quit;


9905       ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
9906       
9907       title 'Spatial Prediction With Kriging';
9908       data thick;
9909       input East North Thick @@;
9910       label Thick='Coal Seam Thickness';
9911       datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.THICK has 75 observations and 3 variables.

9937       ;
9938       ods graphics on;
9939       proc krige2d data=thick;
9940       coordinates xc=East yc=North;
9941       predict var=Thick radius=60;
9942       model scale=7.4599 range=30.1111 form=gauss;
9943       grid x=0 to 100 by 2.5 y=0 to 100 by 2.5;
9944       run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA6 has 1681 observations and 7 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE KRIGE2D printed pages 719-720.

9945       ods graphics off;
9946       
9947       run; quit;
